{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっか行きたいなぁ。\n遠くでも近くでも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日仕事していたらわからなくなっちゃうけど、あっという間に季節は過ぎていくなあ。\nでも充実してるし、がんばる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ、みりあと2人で\n『ジェットコースターごっこ』をやってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジェットコースターに乗ってる気分で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢うわぁぁぁぁーーーひゅーーーーいえーーーいわーーーーい｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってひと通り騒いで、最後に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢...って、やりたいよね〜｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう遊び。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊園地とか行きたい（涙目）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、今日と、名古屋のみなさん\n握手会有難うございました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：Crisp"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：Crisp"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：NIKE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾍｱﾋﾟﾝ：DHOLIC"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握は、琴子と"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同郷レーンでした！わぁ嬉しい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくでも、おんなじチームで\n2年間一緒だし！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな『じょしらく 弐』の\nキービジュアルが公開されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マリィさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口の悪さがね、稽古してて楽しいです笑\nいつかもっとボーイッシュな役もやってみたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまんねぇこと聞くなよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の金髪ショートも好きだったけど、茶髪ロングも結構気に入ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どおかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お芝居ならどんな人物にもなれるから楽しいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月2日深夜25:29〜 日本テレビ\n『NOGIBINGO!6 』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんとペアルックでデートしたよっ\nこういうの初めてだからあたふたして半端なかったです。\n見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/30/2146011/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}